15be0a728626598.jpg" width="3072" height="4096" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f8b611df7e8a00b00ff88ec3b7b5509828626598.jpg" width="1080" height="2403" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/99006403a7e6f11a77e8d6d17552fe7c28626598.jpg" width="1200" height="2670" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/447d8c652583f40f1fa98e15cbafdd9428626598.jpg" width="1200" height="2670" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/393395cf1c8d4e043cd94d5f77b90cbd28626598.jpg" width="1170" height="2532" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/86f883676153de819b02520c615ff8eb28626598.jpg" width="1200" height="1008" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/00756e26ec28a15d90a20507a35119d528626598.jpg" width="1200" height="2670" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/fd85adfe87c8f2d36f26a361576d212b28626598.jpg" width="1200" height="2670" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;图文地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1157709255024836614"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1157709255024836614&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1157709255024836614</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1157709255024836614</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Jan 2026 11:03:11 GMT</pubDate><author>有山先生</author></item><item><title>被两句诗骗来玉门关，结果就是个土块！?</title><description>被两句诗骗来玉门关，结果就是个土块！?&lt;br&gt;长按点赞，一键三连！！&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2d4d553b1c92033cce7b916840af1e97369b5b3a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;视频地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y7iLBXE27"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y7iLBXE27&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y7iLBXE27</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y7iLBXE27</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 09:00:10 GMT</pubDate><author>有山先生</author><category>万物研究所</category></item><item><title>听千万次的问有感，千问有山何时百大口占？</title><description>听千万次的问有感，千问有山何时百大口占？&lt;br&gt;祝大家新年快乐，2026马到成功！&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ea35db8f5a2df1221afb9ce3a8ac80555e3c0fe4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;视频地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RFvWBVEko"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RFvWBVEko&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RFvWBVEko</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RFvWBVEko</guid><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 11:31:33 GMT</pubDate><author>有山先生</author><category>和2026先干一杯</category></item><item><title>人言“太白仙才，长吉（李贺的字）鬼才。”与李白“诗仙”的飘逸超凡相比，李贺的“诗鬼”更凸显其幽深险怪、不蹈常轨的创造性，成为中唐诗歌中独树一帜的奇峰。...</title><description>人言“太白仙才，长吉（李贺的字）鬼才。”与李白“诗仙”的飘逸超凡相比，李贺的“诗鬼”更凸显其幽深险怪、不蹈常轨的创造性，成为中唐诗歌中独树一帜的奇峰。但由于李贺是贵族出身，且27岁就死了，没有太多人生经历，故他的诗歌创作相对狭窄。最要命的是他的思维太跳跃，按现在流行话语叫“梦到哪儿说到哪儿”，存在“有单句”而“无整篇”的局限性。但无疑的，李贺的单句绝逼是诗坛最顶尖的存在，“天若有情天亦老”“黑云压城城欲摧”“提携玉龙为君死”“昆山玉碎凤凰叫”“一泓海水杯中泻”“秋坟鬼唱鲍家诗”......太牛了。大家比较喜欢李贺的哪句诗呢？&lt;br&gt;//转发自: @有山先生: 我把自己焊成铜人，在高平陵朗诵《金铜仙人辞汉歌》&lt;br&gt;拍摄这期视频不幸高烧39℃，劳苦功高，希望大家投币鼓励，有山顿首！！&lt;br&gt;《金铜仙人辞汉歌》是唐代诗人李贺因病辞职由京师长安赴洛阳途中所作的一首诗。诗人借金铜仙人辞汉的史事，来抒发兴亡之感、家国之痛和身世之悲。全诗设想奇特，而又深沉感人；形象鲜明，而又变幻多姿；词句奇峭，而又妥帖绵密。此诗充满了浪漫主义色彩，是李贺的代表作品之一。特别是其中“天若有情天亦老”一句，已成为传诵千古的名句。&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/23223df21fea3f03a506fa9aa46e39ed19b1c067.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;视频地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 Dec 2025 11:27:12 GMT</pubDate><author>有山先生</author></item><item><title>拍摄这期视频不幸甲流39℃，顶着高烧讲李贺的《金铜仙人辞汉歌》，兄弟们，我做得对吗？</title><description>拍摄这期视频不幸甲流39℃，顶着高烧讲李贺的《金铜仙人辞汉歌》，兄弟们，我做得对吗？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/7213eb0d9face85099c3b06b41795d1428626598.jpg" width="1500" height="1835" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/52dab4d753815ea3e910a35fe7f735e528626598.jpg" width="1920" height="1080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/70a504e683325c91508f08444425e0b028626598.jpg" width="1199" height="1123" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;图文地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148048043915870226"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148048043915870226&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148048043915870226</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148048043915870226</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 Dec 2025 10:12:45 GMT</pubDate><author>有山先生</author></item><item><title>我把自己焊成铜人，在高平陵朗诵《金铜仙人辞汉歌》</title><description>我把自己焊成铜人，在高平陵朗诵《金铜仙人辞汉歌》&lt;br&gt;拍摄这期视频不幸高烧39℃，劳苦功高，希望大家投币鼓励，有山顿首！！&lt;br&gt;《金铜仙人辞汉歌》是唐代诗人李贺因病辞职由京师长安赴洛阳途中所作的一首诗。诗人借金铜仙人辞汉的史事，来抒发兴亡之感、家国之痛和身世之悲。全诗设想奇特，而又深沉感人；形象鲜明，而又变幻多姿；词句奇峭，而又妥帖绵密。此诗充满了浪漫主义色彩，是李贺的代表作品之一。特别是其中“天若有情天亦老”一句，已成为传诵千古的名句。&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/23223df21fea3f03a506fa9aa46e39ed19b1c067.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;视频地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1REqGBEEGU</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 Dec 2025 09:00:10 GMT</pubDate><author>有山先生</author><category>三国谋定天下</category></item><item><title>望周知，b站up主有山先生被刊登上c刊了[支持]今晚五点发新视频（狠活），八点直播[爱心]</title><description>望周知，b站up主有山先生被刊登上c刊了[支持]今晚五点发新视频（狠活），八点直播[爱心]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8c20c60a35c53d2d4a8d5bd5ea41b27228626598.jpg" width="1200" height="2670" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c58d31bff59b8e9d4a5f9342af0df45d28626598.jpg" width="1200" height="1896" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;图文地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148012103597031426"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148012103597031426&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148012103597031426</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148012103597031426</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 Dec 2025 07:53:17 GMT</pubDate><author>有山先生</author></item></channel></rss>